AudD  ·  profile default
                 │  Getting started   Guide   Commands  [Keys]  Exit codes and …
 1 Recognize     │ Everywhere
 2 Now playing   │   ctrl+k or :    command palette: run any command
 3 Streams       │   1-7            jump to a section
 4 History       │   ↑/↓ j/k        move in the sidebar
 5 Account       │   enter          open the section
 6 Settings      │   esc            back (to the sidebar)
*7 Help          │   y              copy the command shown at the bottom
                 │   ?              keys for this screen
                 │   F1             help
                 │   q              quit (ctrl+c always quits)
                 │ 
                 │ Recognize
                 │   ↑/↓ tab        move between fields
                 │   ←/→            Source: a file or the microphone
                 │   space          tick a box
                 │   ctrl+o         pick a file or folder
                 │   enter          next field, or press a button
                 │   s              stop a batch or a recording
 ctrl+k commands │   o, c, d        result: open, copy the link, details
 ? keys  q quit  │ 
↑/↓ scroll  [ ] pages
ctrl+k runs any audd command